# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# 包管理器统一为 pnpm（部署脚本亦使用 pnpm），忽略 npm 生成的锁文件
/package-lock.json

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.next-dev.*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
!.env.example

# vercel
.vercel

# database
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# clerk configuration (can include secrets)
/.clerk/
.cozeproj/reduction

# ===== 内部文档（不入库）=====
# 计划书 / 规划书 / 赛事材料等内部工作文档，仅保留在本地
*计划书*
*规划书*
*任务规划*
*任务书*
*梳理*
*比赛*
*赛事*
*日志*
*.log
_removed_from_repo/
/内部文档/
